 240.063240247767 | 6.13413059813973 | 17.86033 | 16.79228 | 16.43001 | 16.30923 | 16.25873 |   3894 |       1 |      243 | 2.4489280322708705e+18 | 0.0003448142 |  2175 | 54612 |      348
